  "notes": [
    "-ER verb with **e→ie stem change** in the presente — affects all forms except nosotros/nosotras",
    "The stem change does **not** appear in pretérito indefinido, imperfecto, futuro, or condicional",
    "Past participle: *entendido* (regular)",
    "Common usage: *no entiendo* (I don't understand), *¿me entiendes?* (do you understand me?), *entenderse con alguien* (to get along with someone)",
    "Note: *entenderse* (reflexive) means to get along / to communicate well with each other — *no os entendéis* = you don't understand each other",
    "Related: *el entendimiento* (understanding), *malentender* (to misunderstand)"
  ],
